   "body": "/claim cloud/m4q-reliab-opus\n\nRe-verified at `dev-swift` @ `fa96c1c1`: `MessageWriteModel.openEditor` guards only its own `progress`/`editor`, then sets `editor` after `editPrefill` without looking at the reader; `requestReply`/`quoteMessage`/`quoteSelection` check `suspendsPageInteractions` only before their awaits; the reply button ignores an edit in flight. No overlap with the open PRs (#1230 touches `TopicReaderModel.swift`'s fetch only).\n\nPlan:\n- One busy notion on the reader: the existing `isLoadingQuote` (\"a composer is being prepared\"), plus `composerSlotIsFree` = no composer open, none being prepared, no reply handed to the screen.\n- \"Editer\" takes the slot before its await (so the reply button and the quotes are refused meanwhile) and is refused while a quote, a reply or a composer holds it.\n- Every path re-checks after its awaits: a composer opened meanwhile (the author menu's MP) drops the late result, with a feedback line.\n- Tests first: a reply asked during an edit prefill is refused and one composer opens; \"Editer\" while a quote is in flight sends nothing; an MP composer opened during the prefill drops the edit with a message.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
